<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African money mkt shortage at 10.81 bln rand Wed.</title>
<headline>S.African money mkt shortage at 10.81 bln rand Wed.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage rose to 10.811 billion rand on Wednesday from 10.414 billion rand on Tuesday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
